desc: Shepard's Pie Shepard Tone Generator (mda Shepard port) by chmaha
tags: generator shepard tone illusion ring modulator
author: chmaha
version: 1.0
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Generates the Shepard tone illusion: a stack of octaves that seems to rise (or fall) for ever without
  getting any higher. Rate sets the speed and direction: right of centre rises, left of centre falls,
  centre holds still. Tones plays only the generator and ignores the input; Ring Mod multiplies the
  input (left + right) by the endless glide; Tones+In adds the input to the tones. The output is mono
  on both channels, as in the original.
  Ported from mda Shepard by Paul Kellett (Maxim Digital Audio), via mda-effects
  https://github.com/pluginguru/mda-effects (MIT or GPLv2+)
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
